    schema:description "We are seeking a Senior QA Engineer to establish and lead quality assurance across a large and growing web platform. This is a critical role responsible for introducing structure, consistency, and confidence into the release process. Key Responsibilities: Quality Assurance: Define and implement QA processes and standards Perform manual testing across multiple websites and applications Own regression testing for releases, migrations, and new features Act as the quality gate before production releases Automation & Improvement: Define and begin implementing a test automation strategy Select tools and identify areas suitable for automation Collaborate with developers and DevOps to improve quality practices Mentor junior QA engineers as the team grows Qualifications: 5+ years of QA experience, primarily web-focused Strong background in manual testing Experience setting up QA processes from scratch Familiarity with modern web stacks and CMS platforms Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills Nice to have: Automation experience (Cypress, Playwright, Selenium, etc.) Experience with accessibility or performance testing Previous lead or senior QA role By applying, I confirm I have read and accepted TransPerfect's Privacy Policy: https://www.transperfect.com/about/data-privacy-recruiting Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
